WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.050
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.050
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:34.030
The cords of this time bomb are tangled up.

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:39.200
Which cord do I cut? If I cut the wrong one, it will explode.

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:41.830
But there's no time.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:48.500
Sonic...

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:52.130
I changed thanks to my encounter with Sonic.

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:55.840
But I can't just keep running behind Sonic!

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:59.930
I'm going to run with my own power someday!

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:02.680
Stay calm. Just stay calm.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:07.810
This cord comes here, so…

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.730
It's this one!

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:13.980
Did I do it?

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.030
I did it!

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:23.700
Thank you, Tails!

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:28.540
Well...

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:33.650
Episode 31

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:33.650
Gamma the Wanderer

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:49.270
Oh yeah, Angel Island is above the ocean.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:50.850
How can I get there?

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:57.780
I know! I'll talk with Tails.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:09.410
With the threat of Eggman ended, the city is enjoying a moment of peace.

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:21.550
I'm currently above the Mystic Ruins.

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:25.260
This area is currently off-limits to the general public.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:29.430
We do not have any new information on the floating island that fell.

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:31.520
It's Angel Island.

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:38.480
Since the status is unclear, this area is also off-limits to the general public.

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:50.040
And for stopping Eggman's time bomb missile, Tails - also known as Miles Prower - will be given a special award by the city.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.540
Your name is Miles Prower?

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.250
Tails is fine.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:59.800
It's true that Tails is a cuter name.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.970
You think so?

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:05.430
Now you won't be able to step outside.

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:06.800
That's fine.

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:09.520
You can stay inside and relax.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:11.930
That would make Cheese and me happy.

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:16.520
I can't. I have to search for X-Tornado.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:21.280
I see! Then leave it to me!

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:35.170
Excuse me, please move out of the way.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:38.040
Are you hiding Tails inside that thing?

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.170
Shock!

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:40.960
Take off the cover and show us what's inside.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:43.010
Show us our hero!

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:46.840
Show us!

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:50.470
Fine. But just for a little while.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:52.020
Babu.

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:55.770
Please be careful.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:58.900
I gave birth to him at Yamato.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:01.360
Daddy, we'll be home soon.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.820
If he's home, that is.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:13.450
You're safe now. It must have been uncomfortable.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:16.460
Just a little. Thanks, Ella.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.960
Thanks to you too, Mr. Tanaka.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:22.050
Please be careful, Tails. Babu.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:23.380
Bye.

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:36.060
You don't have to listen to Eggman anymore.

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:37.730
Eggman.

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:41.570
Dr. Eggman, Gamma's master.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:42.650
Why?

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:51.620
Beta, Delta, Epsilon.

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:54.120
Stop, Sonic.

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.790
Why are you saving me?

00:05:56.790 --> 00:06:00.750
Because I said that the next time we meet, we'll meet as friends.

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.090
Friends.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:12.350
You don't have to listen to Eggman anymore.

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:23.860
Erasing Eggman from 'Master' status.

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:30.110
I will save my friends and teammates.

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:49.720
What is that?

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:51.760
Are you inviting me?

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:17.080
Whatever happens, happens.

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:40.180
What is this?

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:46.520
A monster and a flood? What does it mean?

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:52.820
When sadness and anger overflow, a great disaster will descend upon us.

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:54.410
Who are you?

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.120
What are you trying to say?

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:05.080
What's going on?

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.590
Where is this?

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:19.260
How could this happen?

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:24.400
No! I have to stop it!

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.830
What was that?

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.830
It wasn't a dream...

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:48.590
Eggman, how dare you show your face!

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:50.920
I'm not going to let you get away this time!

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:59.050
When did he have time to build this base?

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:11.320
Sonic showed up here?

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:12.940
Oh yeah!

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:18.780
I'll make you regret coming here.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.790
Can you keep up with me?

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.170
This is only the beginning.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:41.180
I'll flatten you like dried squid, Sonic!

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.190
You punk!

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:54.530
In that case, we're fighting in midair!

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:58.110
Is playtime over?

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:00.200
Boo!

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:04.450
Hooray! I scared you!

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.790
Whatever. So what's it going to be this time?

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:10.670
I'm here to give you a message from Dr. Eggman.

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:14.130
Clean out your ears and listen carefully.

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:22.010
Sonic, the time has come for us to settle things once and for all.

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:25.600
I'll be waiting for you in the deepest section of Final Egg.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:29.560
After delivering this message, this robot will automatically...

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:31.310
Whatever, it doesn't matter.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:37.360
I hate you, Dr. Eggman!

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:46.910
You actually stayed instead of running away, Eggman.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:49.250
How dare you say that, Sonic!

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:53.130
How dare you interfere with my plans every time!

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:58.420
You wrecked my plans for conquering the world!

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:01.090
You defeated Chaos, which was my final hope!

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:04.140
You also destroyed Egg Carrier!

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.310
You will pay for this with your life!

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:09.310
I'll show you the ace up my sleeve.

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:11.940
You're finished this time, Sonic!

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:17.280
I'll teach you that no matter how many times you try, you will always fail!

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:20.070
You won't be talking big for much longer!

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:31.330
Are you also trying to destroy Final Egg?

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:34.540
You're destroying it yourself.

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:46.640
Eggman, it's pointless to try to escape.

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:00.530
Sonic, you're finished!

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:23.550
You'll pay for this, Sonic!

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:27.220
How frustrating!

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:37.980
I'm heading home.

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:13.060
Initiating E-100 Series data search.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:18.610
Match found at Windy Valley. Going to confirm.

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:30.950
Your siblings are on Egg Carrier?

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:33.540
But where did it crash?

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:41.130
What's Egg Carrier?

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:44.800
It's Eggman's flying ship.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:50.010
Oh, you mean that big ship.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.600
You can talk?

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:56.350
Froggy can't talk.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.190
It was me.

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:00.860
Who are you?

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:08.240
I'm Big, and that's my friend Froggy. Nice to meet you.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.490
Hi, I'm Amy.

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:13.540
There's a big ship over there.

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:16.750
No way!

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:51.700
Erasing 'Master' status from Delta.

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:05.920
Confirming shutdown of E-103, Delta.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:08.220
This is good.

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:13.600
Erasing 'Master' status from Epsilon.

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:25.610
Confirming shutdown of E-104, Epsilon.

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:32.110
E-105, Zeta and E-101, Beta, whereabouts unknown.

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:36.490
Gamma will help its friends.

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:58.100
They may still be inside Egg Carrier.

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:12.610
I didn't think we would be coming back here again.

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:24.540
Do you think your siblings will still be here?

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:28.670
I see. You know that they're here.

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:30.880
Okay, let's go.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:43.060
Beginning date search for E-100 Series.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.390
Match found.

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:55.610
This place is so big that I don't know where to start searching.

00:16:57.070 --> 00:17:00.790
Don't worry. I'm sure we'll find your siblings.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:02.120
Trust me.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:10.500
Finally!

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.920
We finally made it out.

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:15.180
We went through another disaster.

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:20.140
We finally escaped, but we're back here again. What's going on?

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:23.060
Yeah. How strange.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:25.100
I wonder what happened to Dr. Eggman?

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:31.610
He's the type that would survive even if the world was turned upside-down, so we don't have to worry about him.

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:34.190
You agree, right?

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:38.320
It's Amy!

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:41.450
Let's capture her and hand her over to Dr. Eggman!

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:44.370
Why is this happening?

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:46.370
Hold it!

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:53.380
What are you doing? Open up!

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:59.260
What is this room?

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:11.440
Zeta.

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:18.030
It's Mr. Robot.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:28.710
This is…

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.250
I don't have time to waste.

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:42.600
I don't have time to waste on you!

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:52.020
Confirming shutdown of Zeta.

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:06.370
Did you hear the noise above?

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:11.880
Beta.

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:26.720
Wait, it's dangerous!

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:32.350
Stop. Eggman destroyed our comrades.

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:34.560
Eggman is our enemy.

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:37.280
Unable to verify Gamma's 'Master' registration.

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:40.820
Designated as an enemy. Enemies must be eliminated.

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:51.250
Beta, we're comrades.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:55.170
Unable to verify Gamma's 'Master' registration.

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:58.880
Designated as an enemy. Enemies must be eliminated.

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:01.050
Stop it!

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:04.220
You're both...

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:19.780
Oh no!

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:25.740
Thank goodness.

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:31.120
Gamma, mission completed.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:38.670
Mr. Robot!

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:08.370
Thank you for saving them.

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:12.200
We'll be friends forever.

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:19.090
Now you can live together with your brothers.

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:41.150
Sonic!

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:44.190
Hey!

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:47.160
Tails, you're okay!

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:49.530
Yeah. Amy's fine too.

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:55.370
It's getting dark.

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:21.110
How dare you, Sonic!

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:25.240
You're making a mistake if you think I'm giving up that easily!

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:28.200
I still have one last plan!

00:22:33.370 --> 00:22:34.700
Chaos?

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:54.450
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:54.450
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:30.050 --> 00:25:35.360
The Scream of Perfect Chaos
